    "sections": {
        "description": "The Electrical Repair theme is a modern, responsive solution designed for electricians and electrical service providers in this vibrant city. It accommodates a wide range of services, including repair, installation, maintenance, and emergency assistance, all while ensuring an attractive and user-friendly experience on any device. With dedicated sections for service highlights, team profiles, and interactive galleries, the theme effectively engages clients. It features Call to Action (CTA) buttons and testimonials to display your professional services. Built with clean, optimized code, customization to align with your brand identity is straightforward. Additionally, it offers seamless integration with WooCommerce for booking and payments, Contact Form 7 for lead generation, and WPML for multilingual support, making it an ideal choice for any house services business aiming to excel online."
    },
